            "description": "<html><body><p data-eci=\"true\"><figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture> <img alt=\"Businessman showing text income concept\" data-id=\"464542974\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1088\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/464542974/image_464542974.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/464542974/image_464542974.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/464542974/image_464542974.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/464542974/image_464542974.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/464542974/image_464542974.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/464542974/image_464542974.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/464542974/image_464542974.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/464542974/image_464542974.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/464542974/image_464542974.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"1536\"/> </picture><figcaption><p class=\"item-caption\"> </p> <p class=\"item-credits\">shutter_m/iStock via Getty Images</p></figcaption></figure></p>  <p><em>By Jennifer Nash</em></p> <p>Official recession calls are the responsibility of the NBER Business Cycle Dating Committee, which is understandably vague about the specific indicators on which it bases its decisions. This <a href=\"https://www.nber.org/cycles/general_statement.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">committee statement</a> is about</p></body></htm